# Rumus SQL untuk Sqflite (Flutter)

Berikut kumpulan "rumus" SQL yang umum dipakai di **sqflite** (SQLite) untuk **create table**, **alter table**, **hapus kolom**, dll.

---

## 1) CREATE TABLE

### Basic
```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  name TEXT NOT NULL,
  email TEXT UNIQUE,
  created_at TEXT DEFAULT (datetime('now'))
);
```

### Dengan foreign key
> Pastikan foreign key aktif (umumnya aktif di SQLite modern; kadang perlu `PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;`).

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS orders (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  user_id INTEGER NOT NULL,
  total INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  created_at TEXT DEFAULT (datetime('now')),
  FOREIGN KEY (user_id) REFERENCES users(id)
    ON UPDATE CASCADE
    ON DELETE CASCADE
);
```

### Composite primary key (tanpa AUTOINCREMENT)
```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS user_roles (
  user_id INTEGER NOT NULL,
  role TEXT NOT NULL,
  created_at TEXT DEFAULT (datetime('now')),
  PRIMARY KEY (user_id, role)
);
```

---

## 2) INSERT

### Insert biasa
```sql
INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES ('Budi', 'budi@mail.com');
```

### Insert banyak data
```sql
INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES
  ('Ani', 'ani@mail.com'),
  ('Siti', 'siti@mail.com');
```

### Insert dari hasil SELECT
```sql
INSERT INTO users (name, email)
SELECT name, email FROM temp_users;
```

---

## 3) SELECT

### Basic
```sql
SELECT * FROM users;
```

### WHERE + ORDER BY + LIMIT
```sql
SELECT id, name, email
FROM users
WHERE name LIKE '%di%'
ORDER BY id DESC
LIMIT 10;
```

### Pagination (LIMIT + OFFSET)
```sql
SELECT *
FROM users
ORDER BY id DESC
LIMIT 10 OFFSET 20; -- page 3 jika perPage=10
```

### JOIN
```sql
SELECT o.id, u.name, o.total, o.created_at
FROM orders o
JOIN users u ON u.id = o.user_id
WHERE o.total > 10000
ORDER BY o.created_at DESC;
```

### GROUP BY + HAVING
```sql
SELECT user_id, COUNT(*) AS total_orders, SUM(total) AS total_amount
FROM orders
GROUP BY user_id
HAVING SUM(total) >= 50000;
```

---

## 4) UPDATE

### Update kolom tertentu
```sql
UPDATE users
SET name = 'Budi Update'
WHERE id = 1;
```

### Update dengan ekspresi
```sql
UPDATE orders
SET total = total + 5000
WHERE id = 10;
```

---

## 5) DELETE

### Delete by id
```sql
DELETE FROM users WHERE id = 1;
```

### Delete semua data (hati-hati)
```sql
DELETE FROM users;
```

---

## 6) UPSERT (INSERT OR ...)

### Abaikan jika sudah ada
```sql
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO users (name, email)
VALUES ('Budi', 'budi@mail.com');
```

### Replace (menghapus row lama lalu insert baru)
> `REPLACE` dapat memicu efek samping: row lama dihapus dulu, lalu insert baru (id bisa berubah kalau PK AUTOINCREMENT tidak dipakai dengan benar).

```sql
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO users (id, name, email)
VALUES (1, 'Budi Replace', 'budi@mail.com');
```

### UPSERT modern (SQLite >= 3.24)
```sql
INSERT INTO users (name, email)
VALUES ('Budi', 'budi@mail.com')
ON CONFLICT(email) DO UPDATE SET
  name = excluded.name;
```

